# tally 2.1.8 R16(d), #183 (B1 of group 3's review, agent/t13; the engine's alone): early, a decision on 01-15,
# has a leg of 100.00 on 03-01; late on 03-01 reads bal(konto, d_late) from d_late. The projection at late's point
# starts from a state that already holds early's 03-01 leg, so it isn't booked again on day t: 500.00 DUK. refcore
# printed it so; a guard, kept as the engine's regression (ce381a0d) is mended.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "probe"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money DUK
input floor: money DUK
input d_mv: date
input d_leg: date
input d_late: date
move early: transfers
  on d_mv
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt + bal(konto) on d_leg
move late: transfers
  on d_late
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount max(0 DUK, floor - bal(konto, d_late) from d_late)
ask a: bal(konto, 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-01), bal(konto, 2026-02-28)
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-02-01, bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-03-01
version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 DUK "c"
  floor = 500.00 DUK "c"
  d_mv = 2026-01-15 "c"
  d_leg = 2026-03-01 "c"
  d_late = 2026-03-01 "c"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start "c"
=== expect
a: (500.00 DUK, 500.00 DUK, 0.00 DUK)
  left out: late, 1 instances, first 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
b: (500.00 DUK, 500.00 DUK)
  left out: late, 1 instances, first 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
